    "note": "Rule 2 demands exactly one owner. The shipped catalog no longer holds a model that two providers both list: replacing the Ollama list on 2026-07-29 removed the last one. The second owner is therefore added here on purpose, so the rule stays tested rather than merely unexercised. Both readers must inject it before building their groups.",
